Package: threeway
Type: Package
Title: Multilinear Methods for Three-Way Data
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", email = "diogo_dj@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Research implementations for tensor and multilinear data analysis,
    including structured matrix operations, Kronecker products, and helpers for
    CANDECOMP/PARAFAC decomposition. The package is being extracted
    incrementally from a broader research codebase.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/three_way_data_decomposition
BugReports: https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/three_way_data_decomposition/issues
